### 팀 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cowork",
  "description": "협업 도구 개발 팀",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

### 내가 속한 팀 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 팀 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 팀 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cowork",
  "description": "협업 도구 개발 팀",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

### 팀 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 팀 아이콘 업로드 URL 발급
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/icon/presigned
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentType": "image/png",
  "fileSize": 102400
}

### 팀 아이콘 변경
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/icon
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "objectKey": "profiles/1/sample.png"
}

### 팀 아이콘 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/icon
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
